# capture.py session: the Lemmings oracle's reference shots, from a cold boot.
#   python tools/capture.py --game lemmings --script games/lemmings/scripts/boot.dbg
# The Skid Row cracktro waits for the left mouse button forever, so a fixed sleep cannot race
# it; F7 is that button (oracle.winuae.in, oracle.fsuae.in). A press with no hold is missed now and then.
!sleep 12
!key f7 0.2
# Psygnosis owl: 32 colours, unchanged for about 7 s.
!until 32
!sleep 1
!shot psygnosis
# DMA Design: 14 colours, unchanged for about 15 s.
!until 14
!sleep 1
!shot dma-design
# A black loading screen with the pointer (3 colours) separates the intro from the menu,
# whose 30 colours the intro also shows.
!until 3
!until 30
!sleep 2
!shot title-menu
